    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>\u25a0 Strategically Build Your Party and Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Experiment with various party and card combinations to find the winning formula. <br>Assemble a party with your favorite characters, obtain rare cards, and enhance them to challenge the Student Council President with your unique strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 The Tyrannical Student Council President \u226aSibylla\u226b </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2da7b2b51b4de48274e51719429912ff.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2da7b2b51b4de48274e51719429912ff.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2da7b2b51b4de48274e51719429912ff.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The witch \u226aLulu\u226b has lost most of her magic after \u226aSibylla\u226b stole her precious heirloom. Will \u226aLulu\u226b defeat the Student Council officers and reclaim her heirloom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 A Challenging Journey for the Troublemaker Witch \u226aLulu\u226b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/1f0438bb1c0ae6d554fd14a6cda227e2.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/1f0438bb1c0ae6d554fd14a6cda227e2.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/1f0438bb1c0ae6d554fd14a6cda227e2.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The path to the Student Council President is perilous. Fight monsters to obtain skill cards, acquire rare relics and scrolls from merchants, and grow stronger. Recruit fearsome Student Council officers to fight alongside you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/b7427aa8135477bee4a0b8efa6a61092.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/b7427aa8135477bee4a0b8efa6a61092.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/b7427aa8135477bee4a0b8efa6a61092.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\tWith 6 playable characters, two modes, 140+ cards, and various monsters, relics, and scrolls, create your own strategies and compete with players worldwide via leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Various Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 'Story Mode' and 'Witch\u2019s Tower Mode'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 6 playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Over 165 cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 64 unique monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 32 relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 26 scrolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A leaderboard to compete with players worldwide based on scores </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>\u25a0 Strategically Build Your Party and Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2811b9bd370efd2f00ef48bb296deb6a.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Experiment with various party and card combinations to find the winning formula. <br>Assemble a party with your favorite characters, obtain rare cards, and enhance them to challenge the Student Council President with your unique strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 The Tyrannical Student Council President \u226aSibylla\u226b </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2da7b2b51b4de48274e51719429912ff.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2da7b2b51b4de48274e51719429912ff.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/2da7b2b51b4de48274e51719429912ff.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The witch \u226aLulu\u226b has lost most of her magic after \u226aSibylla\u226b stole her precious heirloom. Will \u226aLulu\u226b defeat the Student Council officers and reclaim her heirloom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 A Challenging Journey for the Troublemaker Witch \u226aLulu\u226b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/1f0438bb1c0ae6d554fd14a6cda227e2.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/1f0438bb1c0ae6d554fd14a6cda227e2.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/1f0438bb1c0ae6d554fd14a6cda227e2.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The path to the Student Council President is perilous. Fight monsters to obtain skill cards, acquire rare relics and scrolls from merchants, and grow stronger. Recruit fearsome Student Council officers to fight alongside you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/b7427aa8135477bee4a0b8efa6a61092.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/b7427aa8135477bee4a0b8efa6a61092.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/b7427aa8135477bee4a0b8efa6a61092.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf\tWith 6 playable characters, two modes, 140+ cards, and various monsters, relics, and scrolls, create your own strategies and compete with players worldwide via leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u25a0 Various Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.poster.avif?t=1745075681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.webm?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775360/extras/9d0f74414ff1fcce796cb5c9550a6112.mp4?t=1745075681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 'Story Mode' and 'Witch\u2019s Tower Mode'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 6 playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Over 165 cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 64 unique monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 32 relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 26 scrolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A leaderboard to compete with players worldwide based on scores </p>",
